sequenceDiagram
  participant C as Customer (SPA)
  participant G as gateway
  participant O as ordering-api
  participant S as Stripe
  participant Q as Service Bus
  participant E as enrollment-api
  C->>G: POST /orders/checkout {programIds: cart}
  G->>O: forward (+ user id)
  O->>O: check offers (catalog), sellers (tenancy), not owned
  O->>S: one Checkout Session for the whole cart
  O->>O: Checkout row (customer) + one Order per program, each in its coach's tenant
  O-->>C: redirect URL
  C->>S: pays once on Stripe-hosted page
  S->>G: webhook checkout.session.completed
  G->>O: forward
  loop each order, inside its coach's tenant
    O->>S: Transfer of the coach's share (idempotent per order)
    O->>O: Order = Paid + outbox row (one transaction, only if still Pending)
  end
  O->>Q: outbox publisher sends OrderPaid per order
  Q->>E: OrderPaid (scales enrollment-api up from zero)
  E->>E: create Enrollment (idempotent on OrderId)
  C->>G: GET /me/programs
